<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6024" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιπολ-έω</span></b> , later form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιπολεύω,</span> mostly in pres.
			(aor. 1, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>N.</u>
			8.6
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attend
				constantly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤδη με γηραιὸν μέρος ἁλικίας ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.158
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>attend on, watch, guard,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἱμέραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>O.</u>
					12.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.124
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέκτρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					8.6
				</span></i>
			; <i>busy oneself with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυρία φρενί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					7.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>tend, treat gently,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρώμαν ἕλκεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.271
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. dat.,
				<i>roam with, accompany,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					680
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
